==Strategy==
Compared to [[White Wind]], Dark Wind has higher overall stats. Even without the ability to knockback your units, that doesn't make it easier to deal with, because it moves too fast for low level [[Secret Crush Cat (Special Cat)|Secret Crush Cat]] to handle, as Secret Crush Cat will be knocked back before its attack lands on Dark Wind successfully. However, if your [[Heartbeat Catcademy (Event Gacha)|Heartbeat Catcademy]] Units are at a decent level (around +20), this is a rather easy stage by simply spam your units and win. However, If your units are at much lower level, it is advised to take advantage of Secret Crush Cat's superior range against Dark Wind, by hiding behind the base and attack safely from there. Additionally, even a level 1 [[Tomboy Lion Cat (Special Cat)|Tomboy Lion Cat]] can function as a decent meatshield so lower level Secret Crush Cats can land hits.

If you happen to not have Secret Crush Cat by now, or couldn't reach the criteria of 120,000 base HP even with Cat Base Defense Up [[Cat Combo]], you may try to use Breakerblast Cannon as main or support damage output. You'll need the [[Ototo Corps|Breakerblast Cannon]] with higher levelled and/or tougher units.

